st. Daily price ranges tightened on the right side of the base.","outcome":"On Sep 27, 2016 it closed at $49.27, its first close above the base high of $49.06. Volume that day was 1.1M shares, 1.21x the prior 10-day average of 920K. It never committed. The best close afterward was $51.41, within 5% of the level, and the chart ends at $47.56.","lesson":"This is an example of a breakout that never resolved. Price chopped around the level without committing either way. Sitting it out, or getting out flat, was a fine read."}}